,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113744","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113744.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113744.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-08T18:01:22Z"},"body":"Fixes #113634.\r\n\r\nThe window resolution without the transparent border is passed to the rendering drivers, but Vulkan and OpenGL force it to the actual window resolution anyway. D3D12 is the only one that actually respects it, but this ends up causing the swap chain to be stretched horizontally by 2 pixels. The behavior can be made consistent across all the rendering drivers by simply passing the actual window resolution.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113744/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":